{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54695","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，气如剪刀形。\n更有散花桃杏（京本作「李」）杂，君王失政后妃称（京本作「嗔」），鲜洁（京本作「解结」）愈爲精。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}